NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"basic-usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Usage"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# TanStack Start app (default, with SSR)\ntanstack create my-app -y\n\n# Router-only SPA (no SSR)\ntanstack create my-app --router-only -y\n\n# Interactive mode to pick add-ons\ntanstack create my-app --interactive","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For visual setup, use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"https://tanstack.com/builder"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"using-add-ons","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Using Add-ons"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# List available add-ons\ntanstack create --list-add-ons\n\n# See add-on details (dependencies, conflicts, options)\ntanstack create --addon-details <id>\n\n# Create with specific add-ons\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons <id1>,<id2>,<id3>\n\n# Add to existing project\ntanstack add <id1> <id2>","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"recipes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recipes"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"full-stack-app","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Full-Stack App"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create my-app\ncd my-app\ncp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with API keys\npnpm dev","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"ci-cd","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CI/CD"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"github-actions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Actions"}]},{"type":"code","value":"name: Create Project\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n    inputs:\n      name:\n        required: true\njobs:\n  create:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - run: npx @tanstack/cli create ${{ inputs.name }} -y","lang":"yaml"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"docker","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Docker"}]},{"type":"code","value":"FROM node:20-slim\nRUN npm install -g @tanstack/cli pnpm\nRUN tanstack create app -y\nWORKDIR /app\nRUN pnpm install && pnpm build\nCMD [\"pnpm\", \"start\"]","lang":"dockerfile"}],"headings":[{"id":"basic-usage","text":"Basic Usage","level":2},{"id":"using-add-ons","text":"Using Add-ons","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"full-stack-app","text":"Full-Stack App","level":3},{"id":"ci-cd","text":"CI/CD","level":2},{"id":"github-actions","text":"GitHub Actions","level":3},{"id":"docker","text":"Docker","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# TanStack Start app (default, with SSR)\ntanstack create my-app -y\n\n# Router-only SPA (no SSR)\ntanstack create my-app --router-only -y\n\n# Interactive mode to pick add-ons\ntanstack create my-app --interactive\n```\n\nFor visual setup, use `https://tanstack.com/builder`.\n\n## Using Add-ons\n\n```bash\n# List available add-ons\ntanstack create --list-add-ons\n\n# See add-on details (dependencies, conflicts, options)\ntanstack create --addon-details <id>\n\n# Create with specific add-ons\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons <id1>,<id2>,<id3>\n\n# Add to existing project\ntanstack add <id1> <id2>\n```\n\n## Recipes\n\n### Full-Stack App\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app\ncd my-app\ncp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with API keys\npnpm dev\n```\n\n## CI/CD\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\nname: Create Project\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n    inputs:\n      name:\n        required: true\njobs:\n  create:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - run: npx @tanstack/cli create ${{ inputs.name }} -y\n```\n\n### Docker\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM node:20-slim\nRUN npm install -g @tanstack/cli pnpm\nRUN tanstack create app -y\nWORKDIR /app\nRUN pnpm install && pnpm build\nCMD [\"pnpm\", \"start\"]\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: examples\ntitle: Examples\n---\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# TanStack Start app (default, with SSR)\ntanstack create my-app -y\n\n# Router-only SPA (no SSR)\ntanstack create my-app --router-only -y\n\n# Interactive mode to pick add-ons\ntanstack create my-app --interactive\n```\n\nFor visual setup, use `https://tanstack.com/builder`.\n\n## Using Add-ons\n\n```bash\n# List available add-ons\ntanstack create --list-add-ons\n\n# See add-on details (dependencies, conflicts, options)\ntanstack create --addon-details <id>\n\n# Create with specific add-ons\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons <id1>,<id2>,<id3>\n\n# Add to existing project\ntanstack add <id1> <id2>\n```\n\n## Recipes\n\n### Full-Stack App\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app\ncd my-app\ncp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with API keys\npnpm dev\n```\n\n## CI/CD\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\nname: Create Project\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n    inputs:\n      name:\n        required: true\njobs:\n  create:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - run: npx @tanstack/cli create ${{ inputs.name }} -y\n```\n\n### Docker\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM node:20-slim\nRUN npm install -g @tanstack/cli pnpm\nRUN tanstack create app -y\nWORKDIR /app\nRUN pnpm install && pnpm build\nCMD [\"pnpm\", \"start\"]\n```\n"}
